  "problem_statement": "fix(vision): forward pasted images on the auto route; fix dead free-tier slug\n\nTwo bugs surfaced by an actual /paste-image (F4) run:\n\n1. cli._run_auto (the \"auto\"/direct-executor route -- what most single-turn\n   requests hit) never drained _REPL_STATE[\"pending_images\"] or passed\n   images= to run_executor(), so F4/`/image`-staged images were silently\n   dropped. Only the orchestrate path (_run_task) drained them. Fixed by\n   mirroring _run_task's staging in _run_auto.\n2. The suggested/default free OpenRouter vision slug\n   (qwen/qwen2.5-vl-72b-instruct:free) 404s -- deprecated upstream.\n   Replaced with nvidia/nemotron-nano-12b-v2-vl:free, verified live against\n   the OpenRouter API (fetched openrouter.ai/api/v1/models directly and\n   parsed for id.endswith(':free') + 'image' in input_modalities, then\n   round-tripped an actual chat completion through it).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
